<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Financial Statement</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .center {
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 48px; margin: 0;">SMU</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 24px; margin-top: 5px;">INTENSIVE ENGLISH PROGRAM (IEP)</h2>
  </div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;">INTERNATIONAL STUDENT FINANCIAL STATEMENT</h2>
  <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;">Please complete and return with required documentation.</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;">SECTION 1: APPLICANT INFORMATION</h3>
  <table style="width: 100%; font-size: 12px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 15%;">SMU ID#</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="applicant_id">{{ applicant_id }}</span> (If unknown, please leave blank.)</td>
      <td style="width: 15%;">Legal name</td>
      <td style="width: 15%;">Last</td>
      <td style="width: 15%;">First</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">MI</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">Gender</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">M &nbsp; F</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td colspan="8" style="padding-top: 10px;">Permanent Address in home country: ____________________________________________________________________</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 15%;">Date of birth</td>
      <td style="width: 15%; text-align: center;">Month</td>
      <td style="width: 15%; text-align: center;">Day</td>
      <td style="width: 15%; text-align: center;">Year</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">City & Country of birth</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px;">I do hereby certify that:</p>
  <ul style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5;">
    <li>I will have sufficient funds in U.S. currency available to me to cover a minimum of one full year of IEP tuition and living expenses as stipulated on the IEP application form, plus adequate funds for my travel to and from the U.S. and for personal expenses. (See the following page for the estimated cost for one year of IEP study)</li>
    <li>These funds can and will be provided during my entire period of studies by the individual or agency noted in Section 2.</li>
    <li>I can make arrangements to have the necessary funds transferred to the U.S. and available to me prior to registration each semester.</li>
    <li>I understand that I will be required to purchase SMU health insurance unless waived by the SMU Memorial Health Center.</li>
    <li>I understand that my educational and living expenses will increase each year at SMU, and I will be prepared to increase the amount of my sponsorship.</li>
  </ul>

  <table style="width: 100%; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 30px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Signature of Student _________________________ Date (Month/Day/Year) _________________________</td>
      <td style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">E-Mail Address _________________________</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">SECTION 2: SPONSOR'S STATEMENT OF FINANCIAL COMMITMENT</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;">I, ____________________________________________________________________, do hereby certify that I am the ____________________________________________________________________ of the applicant named in Section 1. I can and will provide all necessary funds (shown on the Intensive English Program application form) to Southern Methodist University during the applicant's IEP study. I certify that the financial documents submitted with this statement are complete and accurate.</p>

  <table style="width: 100%; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Sponsor's address: ____________________________________________________________________</td>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Telephone number (including country/city code): _________________________</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Signature of Sponsor _________________________ Date (Month/Day/Year) _________________________</td>
      <td style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">E-Mail Address _________________________</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">SECTION 3: ORIGINAL FINANCIAL VERIFICATION</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;">This statement must appear on the letterhead of your bank or financial institution. Please see instructions on the following page.</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #000; font-size: 12px;">
    <p>SMU Intensive English Program (IEP)</p>
    <p>Phone 1-214-768-1701</p>
    <p>PO Box 750517, Dallas TX 75275-0517</p>
    <p style="text-align: right;">smu.edu/iep</p>
    <p style="text-align: right;">iep@smu.edu</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;">ESTIMATED EXPENSES & FINANCIAL REQUIREMENTS</h2>
  <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;">NOTE: An initial 120 for new IEP students is good for TWO YEARS, which is the total length of study to go through all the IEP levels. Still to apply for an 120, financial documents should demonstrate a minimum of <span data-field="minimum_required_funds">{{ minimum_required_funds }}</span> (which is an estimate of one year of study and living cost for single student without dependents) available.</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;">SOURCE OF FUNDS IN U.S. DOLLARS</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;">Please see below the breakdowns of costs for ONE year of IEP study and check the boxes below as appropriate, and enter the amount of funds for each source in the blanks that follow.</p>

  <table style="font-size: 12px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Term</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Tuitions & Fee (all books and materials, international student fees included)</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Health Insurance (mandatory for all international students)</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Living Cost</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Fall</td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_fall">{{ tuition_fall }}</span> + <span data-field="fee_fall">{{ fee_fall }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="insurance_fall">{{ insurance_fall }}</span></td>
        <td>Student alone: <span data-field="living_fall_single">{{ living_fall_single }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Spring</td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_spring">{{ tuition_spring }}</span> + <span data-field="fee_spring">{{ fee_spring }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="insurance_spring">{{ insurance_spring }}</span></td>
        <td>Spouse: <span data-field="living_spring_spouse">{{ living_spring_spouse }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>May</td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_may">{{ tuition_may }}</span> + <span data-field="fee_may">{{ fee_may }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="insurance_may">{{ insurance_may }}</span></td>
        <td>Each dependent: <span data-field="living_may_dependent">{{ living_may_dependent }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Summer</td>
        <td><span data-field="tuition_summer">{{ tuition_summer }}</span> + <span data-field="fee_summer">{{ fee_summer }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="insurance_summer">{{ insurance_summer }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Sum</td>
        <td><span data-field="total_tuition">{{ total_tuition }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="total_insurance">{{ total_insurance }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="total_living">{{ total_living }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px;">
    <label><input type="checkbox" data-field="student_funds_checked" value="{{ student_funds_checked }}"> Student's personal funds $ _________</label><br>
    <label><input type="checkbox" data-field="family_funds_checked" value="{{ family_funds_checked }}"> Family or relatives' funds (Sponsor's Statement* below to be filled) $ _________</label><br>
    <label><input type="checkbox" data-field="other_funds_checked" value="{{ other_funds_checked }}"> Other sponsor or government agency $ _________</label>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 15px;">Total fund available $ ____________________________________________________________________</p>
  <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px;">Note: Total of all available funds listed above must be equal to or greater than TOTAL COSTS AND ESTIMATED PENNES (a minimum of <span data-field="minimum_total_costs">{{ minimum_total_costs }}</span>).</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">BANK DOCUMENTATION as a valid financial document</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;">An <span data-field="original_bank_letter">{{ original_bank_letter }}</span> must be included with the application package. The bank letter must:</p>
  <ol style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5;">
    <li>Cover at least <span data-field="bank_cover_amount">{{ bank_cover_amount }}</span> (without dependents). The bank does not have to show all of the funds available to the individual in the bank letter.</li>
    <li>Be current—no more than six months old.</li>
    <li>Be on official and original letterhead.</li>
    <li>Be signed by a bank official.</li>
    <li>Include the official bank stamp or be notarized.</li>
    <li>State the currency of the funds.</li>
    <li>Specify the type of account (preferably a savings or similar account).</li>
    <li>Monthly computerized bank statements or deposit slips are not acceptable!</li>
  </ol>
</div>
</body>
</html>